{"level": "Pre-Intermediate", "number": 1, "title": "Workbook \u00b7 Unit 1B & 1D \u2014 Communication", "kind": "handout", "passages": {}, "layout": "<div class=\"booklet\" data-lang=\"uz\"><p><span>WORKBOOK  \u00b7  PRE-INTERMEDIATE  \u00b7  UNIT 1</span></p><p><span>Communication</span></p><p><span>1B I&#x27;m really into social media  \u00b7  1D I&#x27;m sending you some photos</span></p><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td><p><span>You will learn to</span></p><p><span>\u2014  </span><span style=\"font-style:italic\">really, absolutely, hardly ever</span> kabi ravishlarni gapda to\u02bbg\u02bbri joyga qo\u02bbyishni</p><p><span>\u2014  </span>uzun va qisqa unli tovushlarni eshitib farqlashni</p><p><span>\u2014  </span>Present Simple va Present Continuous ni farqlashni \u2014 <span style=\"font-style:italic\">She loves\u2026 \u00b7 She's studying\u2026</span></p><p><span>\u2014  </span>elektron xatni o\u02bbqib tushunishni va gapdagi xatolarni topib tuzatishni</p><p><span>\u2014  </span>ta\u02bctil haqida do\u02bbstingizga xat yozishni</p></td></tr></table><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#127D80;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;border-left:0;border-right:0\"><p style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:13pt\">1</span></p></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;border-top:0;border-bottom:1px solid #127D80;border-left:0;border-right:0\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0B5456;font-size:12.5pt\">1B Vocabulary  \u00b7  adverbs</span></p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#127D80;font-size:12pt\">1.1  </span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">1a</span>  Put the words in brackets in the correct place in each sentence.</span></p><p class=\"hx-uz\" lang=\"uz\" style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\">Qavsdagi so\u02bbzlarni har bir gapda to\u02bbg\u02bbri joyga qo\u02bbying. Butun gapni yozing.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">1  </span>They see their grandchildren now that they live in Australia. (hardly ever)  \u2192  <span style=\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">They hardly ever see their grandchildren now that they live in Australia.</span>  <span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">(example)</span></span></p><p data-item=\"1.1:2\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">2  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">I enjoy watching old Hollywood films. (particularly)  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"1\" style=\"width:95%\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"the sentence\"></span></p><p data-item=\"1.1:3\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">3  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">She hates it when people are late for meetings. (absolutely)  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"2\" style=\"width:95%\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"the sentence\"></span></p><p data-item=\"1.1:4\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">4  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">We go to Italian restaurants, but sometimes we go to Turkish ones. (usually)  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"3\" style=\"width:95%\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"the sentence\"></span></p><p data-item=\"1.1:5\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">5  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">We're sure his flight arrives at Terminal 2, but I need to check. (pretty)  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"4\" style=\"width:95%\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"the sentence\"></span></p><p data-item=\"1.1:6\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">6  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">I hope he brings his beautiful sister to the party! (really)  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"5\" style=\"width:95%\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"the sentence\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#127D80;font-size:12pt\">1.2  </span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">1b</span>  Choose the correct adverbs to complete the sentences.</span></p><p class=\"hx-uz\" lang=\"uz\" style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\">Gaplarni to\u02bbldirish uchun to\u02bbg\u02bbri ravishni tanlang.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">1  </span>I love rock music, but I <span style=\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">especially</span> like the Foo Fighters. They're my favourite band.  <span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">(example)</span></span></p><p data-item=\"1.2:2\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">2  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">He <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"6\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> calls his mother \u2013 maybe once or twice a month.</span></p><p data-item=\"1.2:3\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">3  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">I <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"7\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> enjoy horror films, but this one was awful!</span></p><p data-item=\"1.2:4\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">4  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">She's <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"8\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> good-looking, but I don't think she's beautiful.</span></p><p data-item=\"1.2:5\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">5  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">I <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"9\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> hate maths. I just don't understand it!</span></p><p data-item=\"1.2:6\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">6  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">She <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"10\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> takes her family out for dinner \u2013 only when it's her birthday.</span></p><p data-item=\"1.2:7\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">7  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">They love all sports, but they're <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"11\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> interested in football. They watch all the matches on TV.</span></p><p data-item=\"1.2:8\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">8  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">It's <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"12\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> cold today, so why don't you take your gloves?</span></p><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#127D80;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;border-left:0;border-right:0\"><p style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:13pt\">2</span></p></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;border-top:0;border-bottom:1px solid #127D80;border-left:0;border-right:0\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0B5456;font-size:12.5pt\">1B Pronunciation  \u00b7  long and short vowels</span></p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#127D80;font-size:12pt\">2.1  </span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">2a</span>  Listen to the words. Do the letters in <span style=\"font-weight:700\">bold</span> make a long vowel sound? Choose <span style=\"font-weight:700\">yes</span> (long) or <span style=\"font-weight:700\">no</span> (short).</span></p><p class=\"hx-uz\" lang=\"uz\" style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\">So\u02bbzlarni tinglang. Qalin harflar uzun unli tovush beradimi? <span style=\"font-style:italic\">yes</span> (uzun) yoki <span style=\"font-style:italic\">no</span> (qisqa) ni tanlang.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-style:italic\">Listen \u2014 track 01.01</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">1  </span>b**ir**thday  \u2192  <span style=\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">yes \u2014 long</span>  <span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">(example)</span></span></p><p data-item=\"2.1:2\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">2  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">b<span style=\"font-weight:700\">a</span>nk  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"13\" style=\"width:60px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></span></p><p data-item=\"2.1:3\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">3  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">cinem<span style=\"font-weight:700\">a</span>  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"14\" style=\"width:60px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></span></p><p data-item=\"2.1:4\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">4  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">f<span style=\"font-weight:700\">oo</span>d  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"15\" style=\"width:60px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></span></p><p data-item=\"2.1:5\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">5  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">p<span style=\"font-weight:700\">ar</span>ty  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"16\" style=\"width:60px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></span></p><p data-item=\"2.1:6\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">6  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">s<span style=\"font-weight:700\">i</span>lly  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"17\" style=\"width:60px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></span></p><p data-item=\"2.1:7\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">7  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">m<span style=\"font-weight:700\">u</span>sic  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"18\" style=\"width:60px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></span></p><p data-item=\"2.1:8\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">8  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">sp<span style=\"font-weight:700\">or</span>t  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"19\" style=\"width:60px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></span></p><p data-item=\"2.1:9\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">9  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">fr<span style=\"font-weight:700\">ie</span>ndly  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"20\" style=\"width:60px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></span></p><p data-item=\"2.1:10\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">10  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">bl<span style=\"font-weight:700\">o</span>g  <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"21\" style=\"width:60px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"></span></p><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#127D80;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;border-left:0;border-right:0\"><p style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#FFFFFF;font-size:13pt\">3</span></p></td><td style=\"vertical-align:top;border-top:0;border-bottom:1px solid #127D80;border-left:0;border-right:0\"><p style=\"margin-bottom:0px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#0B5456;font-size:12.5pt\">1B Grammar  \u00b7  present simple and present continuous</span></p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#127D80;font-size:12pt\">3.1  </span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">3a</span>  Choose the correct verb forms to complete the sentences.</span></p><p class=\"hx-uz\" lang=\"uz\" style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\">Gaplarni to\u02bbldirish uchun fe\u02bclning to\u02bbg\u02bbri shaklini tanlang.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">1  </span>She <span style=\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">loves</span> reading fashion magazines at the hairdresser's.  <span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">(example)</span></span></p><p data-item=\"3.1:2\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">2  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">We usually <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"22\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> to the caf\u00e9 opposite the hotel.</span></p><p data-item=\"3.1:3\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">3  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">I <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"23\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> a great book in English at the moment.</span></p><p data-item=\"3.1:4\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">4  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">He <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"24\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> to call his family in Tokyo. Can he use the wi-fi?</span></p><p data-item=\"3.1:5\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">5  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">Why <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"25\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> for the bus? Let's walk home.</span></p><p data-item=\"3.1:6\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">6  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">I hardly ever <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"26\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> my cousins in Ireland.</span></p><p data-item=\"3.1:7\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">7  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">She <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"27\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> French politics at university this term.</span></p><p data-item=\"3.1:8\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.75px;line-height:1.33333;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#6E6E6E;font-size:9.5pt\">8  </span><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\">Yes, they're here. They <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"28\" style=\"width:130px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> a video game in the living room.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\"><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#127D80;font-size:12pt\">3.2  </span><span style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">3b</span>  Complete the conversation with the present simple or present continuous forms of the verbs in brackets. Use contractions where possible.</span></p><p class=\"hx-uz\" lang=\"uz\" style=\"margin-top:10px;margin-bottom:5px;padding-left:32px\">Suhbatni qavsdagi fe\u02bcllarning Present Simple yoki Present Continuous shakli bilan to\u02bbldiring. Imkon bo\u02bblsa, qisqa shaklni ishlating (<span style=\"font-style:italic\">'s, don't</span>). Keyin tinglab tekshiring.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">MEGAN</span>  What (1) <span style=\"font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">'s Andrea doing</span> (Andrea, do) in that shop?</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">NAOMI</span>  She (2) <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"29\" style=\"width:150px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> (buy) some postcards to send to her family.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">MEGAN</span>  Really? I (3) <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"30\" style=\"width:150px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> usually (4) <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"31\" style=\"width:150px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> (not send) postcards. I usually (5) <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"32\" style=\"width:150px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> (write) a message on Facebook. And sometimes I (6) <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"33\" style=\"width:150px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> (post) a few photos of my holiday on Instagram.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">NAOMI</span>  Yes, me too, but Andrea's grandparents (7) <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"34\" style=\"width:150px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> (not use) social media, so she (8) <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"35\" style=\"width:150px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> (send) them postcards instead.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">MEGAN</span>  Oh, and what (9) <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"36\" style=\"width:150px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> (Marco and Jack, do) this morning?</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">NAOMI</span>  They (10) <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"37\" style=\"width:150px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> (spend) the day at the beach.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">MEGAN</span>  But Marco (11) <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"38\" style=\"width:150px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> (not like) swimming in the sea. He says the water's too cold.</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:700\">NAOMI</span>  Yes, but it (12) <input class=\"bk-blank\" data-q=\"39\" style=\"width:150px\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\"> (be) really hot today!</span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:6px;line-height:1.45;padding-left:48px\"><span style=\"color:#1A1A1A;font-size:11.5pt\"><span style=\"font-style:italic\">3c  Listen and check \u2014 track 01.02</span></span></p><table class=\"bk\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;background:#127D80;border-top:0;bor